!!! oculus/input/smoke.mat
!!! Smoke test for input routing.
!!!
!!! Exercises: creating keyboard/pointer events, focus,
!!! pointer state, and the routing table.

book oculus.input.smoke

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.input.event
read everything from oculus.input.focus
read everything from oculus.input.pointer
read everything from oculus.input.routing

main returns number begin paragraph
    !!! Create a keyboard event (space pressed).
    value kb is build keyboard-event with key-code being 32, is-pressed being true, timestamp being 100
    
    when kb.is-pressed is at least 1 then
        say "keyboard event created"
    otherwise
        say "keyboard event failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create a pointer event at position (100, 200).
    value cursor is build point with x being 100, y being 200
    value pt is build pointer-event with position being cursor, button-mask being 0, is-moved being true, timestamp being 101
    
    when pt.is-moved is at least 1 then
        say "pointer event created"
    otherwise
        say "pointer event failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create input focus on window ID 5.
    value focus is build input-focus with focused-window-id being 5, has-focus being true
    
    when focus.has-focus is at least 1 then
        say "focus is set"
    otherwise
        say "focus failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create pointer state at (100, 200).
    value ptr is build pointer-state with cursor-position being cursor, active-button being 0, is-hovering-window being false
    
    !!! Create the routing table.
    value table is build routing-table with focus being focus, pointer-state being ptr, viewport-width being 1200, viewport-height being 675
    
    when table.viewport-width is at least 1200 then
        say "routing table created"
    otherwise
        say "routing table failed"
    end when
    
    when table.viewport-height is at least 675 then
        say "routing table height correct"
    otherwise
        say "routing table height failed"
    end when
    
    give 0
end paragraph
